  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Being able to have a book that you can always have no matter what world your in that you can take out of your inventory that can load pdfs from your computer onto so you can sit in rooms and read books inside VR. One that you could actually flip through the pages like its a real book. Or an inventory you carry items in maybe programmed items like books or mp3 players or cell phones you can call other VR characters with or a little video players or something. Maybe if you could carry around a board game like monopoly  or cards you could play cards with. incorporate digimon cards or something or normal cards. More stuff so when your in a map you can do fun things with other people. Maybe desktop streaming for playing 2d video games with people online or something. ",
